#. i18n: file dialogs/SheetSelectWidget.ui line 119
#: rc.cpp:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<b>List of all available sheets.</b>"
"<br>\n"
"To print a sheet you have to select one or more sheets in this list and use the "
"buttons to insert the selected sheet(s) in the right-hand list, which lists all "
"sheets that are printed."
"<br>\n"
"You can insert a sheet as often as you like, this way it will be printed "
"multiple times. This is useful for dividers or title pages, for example."
msgstr ""
"<b>List vun all verföögbor Tabellen.</b>"
"<br>\n"
"För't Drucken vun en Tabell mutt tominnst een Tabell ut disse List utsöcht "
"wesen un mit de Knööp na de Drucklist rechterhand inföögt warrn."
"<br>\n"
"En Tabell lett sik as faken infögen, as se bruukt warrt, t.B., wenn se mehrmaal "
"druckt warrn schall. Dat is t.B. goot för Trennblääd oder Titelsieden."

#. i18n: file dialogs/SheetSelectWidget.ui line 133
