msgstr "Utsöcht Tabell na baven verschuven."

#. i18n: file dialogs/SheetSelectWidget.ui line 161
#: rc.cpp:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "Move selected sheet down."
msgstr "Utsöcht Tabell na nerrn verschuven."

#. i18n: file dialogs/SheetSelectWidget.ui line 175
#: rc.cpp:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Move selected sheet to the bottom."
msgstr "Utsöcht Tabell heel na nerrn verschuven."

#. i18n: file dialogs/SheetSelectWidget.ui line 181
#: rc.cpp:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selected Sheets"
msgstr "Utsöcht Tabellen"

#. i18n: file dialogs/SheetSelectWidget.ui line 209
#: rc.cpp:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "List of sheets to print in given order."
msgstr "List vun Tabellen de in de angeven Reeg druckt warrt."

#. i18n: file dialogs/SheetSelectWidget.ui line 214
#: rc.cpp:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<b>List of sheets to print.</b>"
"<br>\n"
"Only the sheets listed here will be printed in the order of listing. You can "
"change the print order with the up and down buttons."
"<br>\n"
"It is even possible to print a sheet more than once. Just insert the desired "
"sheet again and order the list to your needs."
msgstr ""
"<b>List vun Tabellen för't Drucken.</b>"
"<br>\n"
"Bloots de hier oplist Tabellen warrt in de angeven Reeg druckt. Ehr Druckreeg "
"lett sik mit de Knööp \"hooch\" un \"daal\" ännern."
"<br>\n"
"En Blatt lett sik ok mehrmaal drucken, wenn dat nochmaal inföögt warrt. De List "
"lett sik na Möög sorteren."

#. i18n: file dialogs/font_cell_format.ui line 17
#: rc.cpp:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can select here the font style, size and color, including some additional "
"options like underlined or striked out text for the current cell text. The "
"lower part of the page gives a preview of the selected text format.\n"
"The default font is set for all cells in the Format -> "
"Style Manager menu with the currently used style."
msgstr ""
"Hier lett sik de Schriftoort ehr Stil, Grött un Klöör utsöken, un noch en poor "
"Optschonen mehr, as t.B. ünnerstreken oder dörstreken Text binnen de aktuelle "
"Zell. Baven warrt en Vöransicht vun't aktuell utsöcht Textformaat wiest.\n"
"De Standardschriftoort warrt för all Zellen in't Menü \"Formaat\" -> "
"\"Stilpleger\" mit den aktuell bruukt Stil fastleggt."

#. i18n: file dialogs/font_cell_format.ui line 34
#: rc.cpp:122 rc.cpp:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "Varying (No Change)"
msgstr "Verscheden (keen Ännern)"

#. i18n: file dialogs/font_cell_format.ui line 54
#: rc.cpp:131 rc.cpp:173
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the style for your font for the currently selected cells. When you "
"select several cells with different styles, the displayed style is set to "
"Varying (No Change) and leaving it that way will keep all your current style "
"settings for each cell. Changing to Roman for example will change all the "
"selected cells style text to Roman."
msgstr ""
"Den Schriftstil för de aktuell utsöcht Zellen utsöken. Wenn mehr Zellen mit "
"anner Stilen utsöcht sünd, warrt de wiest Stil na \"Verscheden (keen Ännern)\" "
"fastleggt un de aktuell Stil för elk Zell so laten. Ännern na \"Roman\" ännert "
"t.B. den Textstil vun all utsöcht Zellen na \"Roman\"."

#. i18n: file dialogs/font_cell_format.ui line 65
#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:2130 rc.cpp:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normaal"

#. i18n: file dialogs/font_cell_format.ui line 70
#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:2132 kspread_view.cc:481 rc.cpp:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bold"
msgstr "Fett"

#. i18n: file dialogs/font_cell_format.ui line 80
#: rc.cpp:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the weight for your font for the currently selected cells. When you "
"select several cells with different font weight, the displayed weight is set to "
"Varying (No Change) and leaving it that way will keep all your current weight "
"settings for each cell. Changing to Bold for example will change all the "
"selected cells font weight to Bold."
msgstr ""
"De Schriftstärk för de aktuell utsöcht Zellen ännern. Wenn mehr Zellen mit "
"verscheden Schriftstärken utsöcht sünd, warrt de dorstellt Stärk na "
"\"Verscheden (keen Ännern)\" fastleggt, un wenn Een dat so lett, warrt de "
"aktuell instellt Schriftstärken för elk Zell wohrt. Ännern na \"Fett\" ännert "
"t.B. de Schriftstärk vun all utsöcht Zellen na \"Fett\"."

