msgstr "Inrücken"

#. i18n: file dialogs/position_cell_format.ui line 230
#: rc.cpp:287
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set the amount of indent that will be used in the cell when you choose the "
"Format -> Increase Indent or Format -> Decrease Indent menus."
msgstr ""
"Dat Inrücken binnen en Zell lett sik mit \"Formaat -> "
"Mehr inrücken\" oder \"Formaat -> Weniger inrücken\" fastleggen."

#. i18n: file dialogs/position_cell_format.ui line 238
#: commands.cc:78 kspread_undo.cc:2173 kspread_view.cc:691 manipulator.cc:914
#: rc.cpp:290
#, no-c-format
msgid "Merge Cells"
msgstr "Zellen tosamenföhren"

#. i18n: file dialogs/position_cell_format.ui line 242
#: rc.cpp:293
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When checked, this has the same effect as Data ->Merge Cells. You need to have "
"at least two consecutive cells selected. Those consecutive cells are then "
"merged into a bigger one.\n"
"When a merged cell is selected and when you uncheck this, then all cells come "
"back to their original size as before the merging. It has the same effect as "
"Data -> Dissociate Cells."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, hett dat de sülve Utwarken as \"Daten -> "
"Zellen tosamenföhren\". Een mutt tominnst twee nevenenanner liggen Zellen "
"utsöken. Disse Zellen warrt denn na en grötter Zell tosamenföhrt.\n"
"Wenn Een en tosamenföhrt Zell markeert un dit utmaakt warrt, stellt de Zell ehr "
"Orginaalgrött ehr't Tosamenföhren wedder her. Dit hatt de sülve Utwarken as "
"\"Daten -> Zellen trennen\"."

#. i18n: file dialogs/position_cell_format.ui line 253
#: rc.cpp:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "Merge cells"
msgstr "Zellen tosamenföhren"

