msgid ""
"If checked, the content of the cell will not be printed. If this is not checked "
"(default), the cell content will be printed.\n"
"Note that you can print it even if the cell is protected"
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt de Zellinholt nich druckt. Wenn dit nich anmaakt is "
"(Standard), warrt de Zellinholt druckt.\n"
"Beacht, dat he sik ok drucken lett, wenn de Zell schuult is"

#. i18n: file dialogs/protection_cell_format.ui line 55
#: rc.cpp:343
#, no-c-format
msgid "Protection"
msgstr "Schuul"

#. i18n: file dialogs/protection_cell_format.ui line 74
#: rc.cpp:346
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hide &all"
msgstr "&All versteken"

#. i18n: file dialogs/protection_cell_format.ui line 77
#: rc.cpp:349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This hides the cell content and works only when the sheet is protected. Whether "
"the cell itself is protected or not does not matter."
msgstr ""
"Dit versteekt den Zellinholt un arbeidt bloots, wenn de Tabell schuult is, "
"eendoont, wat de Zell sülvst schuult is oder nich."

#. i18n: file dialogs/protection_cell_format.ui line 110
#: rc.cpp:352
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Protected"
msgstr "&Schuult"

#. i18n: file dialogs/protection_cell_format.ui line 116
#: rc.cpp:355
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If checked, the cell content will be protected. This is the default behaviour. "
"You need to protect the whole sheet using theTools->Protect document->"
"Protect Sheet... menu for this individual cell protection to work. See the "
"manual for more details in the Advanced KSpread chapter. When a cell is "
"protected, its content cannot be changed."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt de Zellinholt schuult. Dit is dat Standardbedregen. "
"Dormit disse Enkelzellschuul arbeidt, mutt de heel Tabell mit \"Warktüüch -> "
"Dokment schulen -> Tabell schulen\" schuult wesen. Binnen den Afsnitt "
"\"Verwiedert\" in't Brukerhandbook vun KSpread lett sik mehr över disse "
"Instellen finnen. Wenn en Zell schuult is, lett sik ehr Inholt nich ännern."

#. i18n: file dialogs/protection_cell_format.ui line 151
#: rc.cpp:358
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Hide formula"
msgstr "Formel &versteken"

#. i18n: file dialogs/protection_cell_format.ui line 154
#: rc.cpp:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this is checked, the cell is still visible. However, its contents do not "
"appear in the Formula bar. Hiding formula is only working for cells that "
"contain formulae so the user cannot view the formula. And the sheet must be "
"protected for this to work."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, lett sik de Zell noch ankieken, man ehr Inholt warrt nich "
"binnen den Formelbalken wiest. Formeln laat sik vör den Bruker bloots "
"versteken, wenn de Zellen Formeln bargt un de Tabell schuult is."

