#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 87
#: rc.cpp:376
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Defaut is that the first column of the sheet is on the left. If you choose "
"Right to Left, then the first column will be on the right and the others added "
"from right to left."
msgstr ""
"Standardwies warrt de eerst Striep vun de Tabell linkerhand wiest. Wenn \"Vun "
"rechts na links\" utsöcht is, warrt de eerst Striep rechts wiest un de nakamen "
"vun rechts na links toföögt."

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 141
#: rc.cpp:379
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show c&omment indicator"
msgstr "&Kommentarmarkeren wiesen"

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 144
#: rc.cpp:382
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this box is checked cells containing comments will be marked by a small red "
"triangle at the top right corner."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt Zellen, de en Kommentar bargt, mit en lütt root "
"Dre'eck baven rechts markeert."

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 152
#: rc.cpp:385
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use &LC mode"
msgstr "&LC-Bedrief bruken"

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 155
#: rc.cpp:388
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this box is checked the cell reference shown at the left end of the Formula "
"Bar will be displayed in LC mode (i.e. L2C3) rather than in its normal form B3. "
"This does not seem to be of much use at the moment."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt de Zellbetog an't linke Enn vun den Formelbalken "
"in'n LC-Bedrief (d.h. L2C3) ansteed vun de Normaaldorstellen (t.B. B3) wiest. "
"As dat lett bringt dat man opstunns nich veel."

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 163
#: rc.cpp:391
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show page &borders"
msgstr "Siet&ränners wiesen"

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 166
#: rc.cpp:394
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you check this option, the page borders will be drawn on your current sheet. "
"Per default the page borders are not displayed. It is useful to see the page "
"borders if you want to print your sheet."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt de aktuell Tabell mit Sietränners wiest. "
"Standardwies warrt de Sietränners versteken. De Sietränners to sehn is goot, "
"wenn Een de Tabell drucken will."

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 174
#: rc.cpp:397
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Convert first letter to uppercase"
msgstr "Eerst Bookstaav na Grootschrift ü&mwanneln"

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 177
#: rc.cpp:400
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this box and the first letter of any text you type in will automatically "
"be converted to uppercase."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn de eerst Bookstaav vun elk Text automaatsch na Grootschrieven "
"ümwannelt warrn schall."

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 185
#: rc.cpp:403
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Hide zero"
msgstr "Null &versteken"

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 188
#: rc.cpp:406
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this box is checked any cell containing the value zero will appear blank."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt elk Zell mit den Weert Null as leddig Zell wiest."

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 196
#: rc.cpp:409
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show &formula"
msgstr "&Formel wiesen"

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 199
#: rc.cpp:412
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this box is checked KSpread will display the actual formulae in cells rather "
"than the results."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt in de Zellen de aktuell Formeln ansteed ehr "
"Resultaten wiest."

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 207
#: rc.cpp:415
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show column as &numbers"
msgstr "Striepen as &Tallen wiesen"

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 210
#: rc.cpp:418
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this box is checked the column headings will show as numbers rather than as "
"letters. Letters are default."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt de Striepöverschriften as Tallen ansteed Bookstaven "
"wiest. Bookstaven sünd Standard."

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 218
#: rc.cpp:421
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show formula &indicator"
msgstr "&Formelmarkeren wiesen"

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 221
#: rc.cpp:424
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this box is checked KSpread will display a small blue triangle at the bottom "
"left corner of cells containing formulae. This is useful if you want to protect "
"cells with formulae."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt binnen Zellen, de en Formel bargt, en lütt blaag "
"Dre'eck nerrn links wiest. Dat bringt wat, wenn Een Zellen mit Formeln schulen "
"will."

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 229
#: rc.cpp:427
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show &grid"
msgstr "&Gadder wiesen"

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 232
#: rc.cpp:430
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If checked the grid (the cell limits) will be shown. This is default. If you "
"uncheck it, the grid willl be hidden."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt dat Gadder (de Zellgrenzen) wiest. Dat is de "
"Standardinstellen. Wenn dit utmaakt is, warrt dat Gadder versteken."

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 240
#: rc.cpp:433
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Automatic recalculation"
msgstr "&Automaatsch nieg utreken"

#. i18n: file dialogs/sheet_properties_base.ui line 243
#: rc.cpp:436
