msgid "IPMT(Rate; Period; NPer; PV; FV; Type)"
msgstr "IPMT(Tins; Periood; NPer; PV; FV; Typ)"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 547
#: xml_doc.cc:2157
#, no-c-format
msgid "IPMT(0.1;3;3;8000) equals -292.45"
msgstr "IPMT(0.1;3;3;8000) gifft \"-292.45\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 558
#: xml_doc.cc:2160 xml_doc.cc:2178
#, no-c-format
msgid "Payment per period"
msgstr "Utbetahlen per Periood"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 570
#: xml_doc.cc:2169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The PV_ANNUITY() function returns the present value of an annuity or stream of "
"payments. For example: a \"million dollar\" lottery ticket that pays $50,000 a "
"year for 20 years, with an interest rate of 5%, is actually worth "
"PV_ANNUITY(50000;0.05;20) or $623,111. This function assumes that payments are "
"made at the end of each period."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon PV_ANNUITY() gifft den aktuellen Weert vun en Rent oder en "
"Geldstroom ut. En \"Een Million\"-Lotterieschien mit en Tinssatz vun 5% t.B., "
"de twintig Johr lang 50000 Dollar in't Johr utbetahlt, is nu  "
"PV_ANNUITY(50000;0,05;20) oder 623,111 Dollar weert. Disse Funkschoon vermoodt "
"de Utbetahlen an't Enn vun elk Periood."

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 571
#: xml_doc.cc:2172
#, no-c-format
msgid "PV_ANNUITY(amount;interest;periods)"
msgstr "PV_ANNUITY(Bedrag; Tins; Perioden)"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 572
#: xml_doc.cc:2175
#, no-c-format
msgid "PV_ANNUITY(1000;0.05;5) equals 4329.48"
msgstr "PV_ANNUITY(1000;0,05;5) maakt 4329,48"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 592
#: xml_doc.cc:2187
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The FV_ANNUITY() function returns the future value of a stream of payments "
"given the amount of the payment, the interest rate and the number of periods. "
"For example: If you receive $500 per year for 20 years, and invest it at 8%, "
"the total after 20 years will be FV_annuity(500;0.08;20) or $22,880.98. This "
"function assumes that payments are made at the end of each period."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon FV_ANNUITY() gifft den tokamen Weert vun en fast Geldstroom "
"torüch, angeven dör de Betahlen, den Tinssatz un de Tall vun Perioden. Wenn Een "
"t.B. twintig Johr lang 500 Dollar in't Johr kriggt un se mit 8% Tinsen anleggt, "
"gifft dat na 20 Johren tosamen en FV_annuity(500;0.08;20) oder 22880,98 Dollar. "
"Disse Funkschoon vermoodt de Utbetahlen an't Enn vun elk Periood."

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 593
#: xml_doc.cc:2190
#, no-c-format
msgid "FV_ANNUITY(amount;interest;periods)"
msgstr "FV_ANNUITY(Bedrag; Tins;Perioden)"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 594
#: xml_doc.cc:2193
#, no-c-format
msgid "FV_ANNUITY(1000;0.05;5) equals 5525.63"
msgstr "FV_ANNUITY(1000;0,05;5) gifft \"5525,63\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 602
#: xml_doc.cc:2196 xml_doc.cc:2217
#, no-c-format
msgid "Principal"
msgstr "Startbedrag"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 610
#: xml_doc.cc:2202
#, no-c-format
msgid "Periods per year"
msgstr "Perioden per Johr"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 614
#: xml_doc.cc:2205 xml_doc.cc:2223 xml_doc.cc:2283 xml_doc.cc:2304
#, no-c-format
msgid "Years"
msgstr "Johren"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 618
#: xml_doc.cc:2208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The COMPOUND() function returns the value of an investment, given the "
"principal, nominal interest rate, compounding frequency and time. For example: "
"$5000 at 12% interest compounded quarterly for 5 years will become "
"COMPOUND(5000;0.12;4;5) or $9030.56."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon COMPOUND() gifft den Weert vun en Geldanlaag torüch, fastleggt "
"dör Startbedrag, nominaal Tinssatz, Optinsperiood un Tiet. 5000 Dollar t.B., de "
"elk Viddeljohr för fief Johr mit 12% optinst warrt maakt "
"COMPOUND(5000;0.12;4;5) oder 9030,56 Dollar."

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 619
#: xml_doc.cc:2211
#, no-c-format
msgid "COMPOUND(initial;interest;periods;periods_per_year)"
msgstr "COMPOUND(Startbedrag;Tins;Perioden;Perioden_per_Johr)"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 620
#: xml_doc.cc:2214
#, no-c-format
msgid "COMPOUND(5000;0.12;4;5) equals 9030.56"
msgstr "COMPOUND(5000;0,12;4;5) gifft \"9030,56\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 640
#: xml_doc.cc:2226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The CONTINUOUS() function calculates the return on continuously compounded "
"interest, given the principal, nominal rate and time in years. For example: "
"$1000 earning 10% for 1 year becomes CONTINUOUS(1000;.1;1) or $1105.17."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon CONTINUOUS() gifft den Ennweert vun en fast optinst Bedrag "
"torüch, angeven dör Startbedrag, nominaal Tinssatz un Tiet in Johren. Ut 1000 "
"Dollar mit 10% Tinsen för een Johr warrt t.B. CONTINUOUS(1000;.1;1) oder "
"1105,17 Dollar."

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 641
#: xml_doc.cc:2229
#, no-c-format
msgid "CONTINOUS(principal;interest;years)"
msgstr "CONTINUOUS(Startbedrag;Tins;Johren)"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 642
#: xml_doc.cc:2232
#, no-c-format
msgid "CONTINUOUS(1000;0.1;1) equals 1105.17"
msgstr "CONTINUOUS(1000;0,1;1) gifft \"1105,17\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 650
#: xml_doc.cc:2235 xml_doc.cc:2250
#, no-c-format
msgid "Nominal interest rate"
msgstr "Nominaal Tinssatz"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 658
#: xml_doc.cc:2241
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The EFFECT() function calculates the effective yield for a nominal interest "
"rate (annual rate or APR). For example: 8% interest compounded monthly provides "
"an effective yield of EFFECT(.08;12) or 8.3%."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon EFFECT() reekt den effektiv Winn för en nominaal Tinssatz (in't "
"Johr oder APR) ut. So kummt t.B. bi en Tinssatz vun 8% elk Maand en effektiv "
"Winn vun EFFECT(.08;12) oder 8.3% bi rut."

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 659
#: xml_doc.cc:2244
#, no-c-format
msgid "EFFECT(nominal;periods)"
msgstr "EFFECT(Tins;Perioden)"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 660
#: xml_doc.cc:2247
#, no-c-format
msgid "EFFECT(0.08;12) equals 0.083"
msgstr "EFFECT(0.08;12) maakt 0.083"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 677
#: xml_doc.cc:2256
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The EFFECTIVE() function calculates the effective yield for a nominal interest "
"rate (annual rate or APR). It is the same as the EFFECT function."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon EFFECTIVE() reekt den effektiv Winn för en nominaal Tinssatz "
"(in't Johr oder APR) ut. Dat is dat sülvige as de Funkschoon EFFECT."

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 678
#: xml_doc.cc:2259
#, no-c-format
msgid "EFFECTIVE(nominal;periods)"
msgstr "EFFECTIVE(Tins;Perioden)"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 687
#: xml_doc.cc:2262
#, no-c-format
msgid "Effective interest rate"
msgstr "Effektiv Tins"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 695
#: xml_doc.cc:2268
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The NOMINAL() function calculates the nominal (stated) interest rate for an "
"effective (annualized) interest rate compounded at given intervals. For "
"example: to earn 8% on an account compounded monthly, you need a return of "
"NOMINAL(.08;12) or 7.72%."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon NOMINAL() reekt den Nominaatinssatz (angeven) för en "
"Effektivtinssatz (op dat Johr ümreekt) för en angeven Tiet ut. Bispeel: Wenn "
"Een 8% op sien Konto kriegen will, mutt Een  NOMINAL(0,08;12) oder 7,72% "
"Nominaaltins kriegen."

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 696
#: xml_doc.cc:2271
#, no-c-format
msgid "NOMINAL(effective;periods)"
msgstr "NOMINAL(Effektivtins;Perioden)"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 697
#: xml_doc.cc:2274
#, no-c-format
msgid "NOMINAL(0.08;12) equals 0.0772"
msgstr "NOMINAL(0,08;12) gifft \"0,0772\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 705
#: xml_doc.cc:2277 xml_doc.cc:2295
#, no-c-format
msgid "Face value"
msgstr "Nennweert"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 717
#: xml_doc.cc:2286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The ZERO_COUPON() function calculates the value of a zero-coupon (pure "
"discount) bond. For example: if the interest rate is 10%, a $1000 bond that "
"matures in 20 years is worth ZERO_COUPON(1000;.1;20) or $148.64."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ZERO_COUPON() reekt den Weert vun en Nullkuponanlehn (aftinst "
"Anlehn) ut. Bispeel: Wenn de Tinssatz 10% is, denn is en Anlehn vun 1000 "
"Dollar, de na 20 Johren tahlbor is, ZERO_COUPON(1000;.1;20) oder 148,64 Dollar "
"weert."

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 718
#: xml_doc.cc:2289
#, no-c-format
msgid "ZERO_COUPON(face value;rate;years)"
msgstr "ZERO_COUPON(Nennweert;Tins;Johren)"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 719
#: xml_doc.cc:2292
#, no-c-format
msgid "ZERO_COUPON(1000;.1;20) equals 148.64"
msgstr "ZERO_COUPON(1000;0,1;20) gifft \"148,64\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 731
#: xml_doc.cc:2298
#, no-c-format
msgid "Coupon rate"
msgstr "Anlehntins"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 735
#: xml_doc.cc:2301
#, no-c-format
msgid "Coupons per year"
msgstr "Anlehnen per Johr"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 743
#: xml_doc.cc:2307
#, no-c-format
msgid "Market interest rate"
msgstr "Markttinssatz"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 747
#: xml_doc.cc:2310
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The LEVEL_COUPON() function calculates the value of a level-coupon bond. For "
"example: if the interest rate is 10%, a $1000 bond with semi-annual coupons at "
"a rate of 13% that matures in 4 years is worth LEVEL_COUPON(1000;.13;2;4;.1) or "
"$1096.95."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon LEVEL_COUPON() reekt den Weert vun en Kuponanlehn ut. Bispeel: Bi "
"en Tinssatz vun 10% is en Anlehn för 1000 Dollar mit halfjohrig Kupons mit en "
"Tins vun13% un veer Johren Looptiet LEVEL_COUPON(1000;.13;2;4;0,1) oder 1096.95 "
"Dollar weert."

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 748
#: xml_doc.cc:2313
#, no-c-format
msgid "LEVEL_COUPON(face value;rate;years)"
msgstr "LEVEL_COUPON(Nennweert;Tins;Johren)"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 749
#: xml_doc.cc:2316
#, no-c-format
msgid "LEVEL_COUPON(1000;.13;2;4;.1) equals 1096.95"
msgstr "LEVEL_COUPON(1000;0,13;2;4;0,1) gifft \"1096,95\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 757
#: xml_doc.cc:2319 xml_doc.cc:2337 xml_doc.cc:2358 xml_doc.cc:2382
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cost"
msgstr "Kösten"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 761
#: xml_doc.cc:2322 xml_doc.cc:2340 xml_doc.cc:2361 xml_doc.cc:2385
#, no-c-format
msgid "Salvage"
msgstr "Restweert"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 765
#: xml_doc.cc:2325 xml_doc.cc:2343 xml_doc.cc:2364 xml_doc.cc:2388
#, no-c-format
msgid "Life"
msgstr "Looptiet"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 769
#: xml_doc.cc:2328
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The SLN() function will determine the straight line depreciation of an asset "
"for a single period. Cost is the amount you paid for the asset. Salvage is the "
"value of the asset at the end of the period. Life is the number of periods over "
"which the asset is depreciated. SLN divides the cost evenly over the life of an "
"asset."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SLN() reekt de lineaar Afschrieven vun en Anlaag för en enkelte "
"Periood ut. \"Kösten\" is dat, wat Een för de Anlaag betahlt hett. "
"\"Restweert\" is de Anlaag ehr Weert an't Enn vun de Looptiet. \"Looptiet\" is "
"de Tall vun Perioden, över de de Anlaag afschreven is. SLN verdeelt de Kösten "
"egaalweg över de Anlaag ehr heel Looptiet."

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 770
#: xml_doc.cc:2331
#, no-c-format
msgid "SLN(cost; salvage value; life)"
msgstr "SLN(Kösten; Restweert; Looptiet)"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 771
#: xml_doc.cc:2334
#, no-c-format
msgid "SLN(10000;700;10) equals 930"
msgstr "SLN(10000;700;10) gifft \"930\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 796
#: xml_doc.cc:2349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The SYD() function will calculate the sum-of-years digits depreciation for an "
"asset based on its cost, salvage value, anticipated life, and a particular "
"period. This method accelerates the rate of the depreciation, so that more "
"depreciation expense occurs in earlier periods than in later ones. The "
"depreciable cost is the actual cost minus the salvage value. The useful life is "
"the number of periods (typically years) over which the asset is depreciated."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SYD() reekt de \"sum-of-years digits\"-Afschrieven "
"(Aritmeetsch-degressiv Afschrieven) för en Anlaag ut, baseert op ehr Kösten, "
"Restweert, verwacht Looptiet un en Afschrievenperiood. Dat gifft en höger "
"Afschrievengraad, so dat de Kösten för de fröher Perioden grötter sünd as för "
"de laten. De afschriefbor Kösten sünd de aktuellen Kösten ahn Restweert. De "
"Bruukduer is de Tall vun Perioden (normalerwies Johren), över de de Anlaag "
"afschreven warrt."

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 797
#: xml_doc.cc:2352
#, no-c-format
msgid "SYD(cost; salvage value; life; period)"
msgstr "SYD(Kösten; Restweert; Looptiet; Periood)"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 798
#: xml_doc.cc:2355
#, no-c-format
msgid "SYD(5000; 200; 5; 2) equals 1280"
msgstr "SYD(5000; 200; 5; 2) gifft \"1280\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 824
#: xml_doc.cc:2370
#, no-c-format
msgid "Factor"
msgstr "Faktor"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 828
#: xml_doc.cc:2373
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The DDB() function calculates the depreciation of an asset for a given period "
"using the arithmetic-declining method. The factor is optional, if omitted it is "
"assumed to be 2. All the parameter must be greater than zero."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon DDB() reekt de Afschrieven vun en Geldanlaag för en angeven "
"Tietduer na de aritmeetsch Restweertmetood ut. De Faktor is optschonaal. Ahn em "
"warrt dor \"2\" för vermoodt. All Parameters mööt grötter as Null wesen."

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 829
#: xml_doc.cc:2376
#, no-c-format
msgid "DDB(cost; salvage value; life; period [;factor])"
msgstr "DDB(Kösten; Restweert; Looptiet; Periood [;Faktor])"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 830
#: xml_doc.cc:2379
#, no-c-format
msgid "DDB(75000;1;60;12;2) returns 1721.81"
msgstr "DDB(75000;1;60;12;2) gifft \"1721.81\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 858
#: xml_doc.cc:2397
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The DB() function will calculate the depreciation of an asset for a given "
"period using the fixed-declining balance method. Month is optional, if omitted "
"it is assumed to be 12."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon DB() reekt de Afschrieven vun en Geldanlaag för en angeven "
"Periood na de fast degressiv Afschrievenmetood ut. \"Maand\" is en optschonaal "
"Angaav. Ahn ehr warrt dor \"12\" för annahmen."

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 859
#: xml_doc.cc:2400
#, no-c-format
msgid "DB(cost; salvage value; life; period [;month])"
msgstr "DB(Kösten; Restweert; Looptiet; Periood [;Maand])"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 860
#: xml_doc.cc:2403
#, no-c-format
msgid "DB(8000;400;6;3) equals 1158.40"
msgstr "DB(8000;400;6;3) gifft \"1158,40\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 861
#: xml_doc.cc:2406
#, no-c-format
msgid "DB(8000;400;6;3;2) equals 1783.41"
msgstr "DB(8000;400;6;3;2) gifft \"1783,41\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 869
#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_csv.cc:151 dialogs/kspread_dlg_csv.cc:466
#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_csv.cc:539 dialogs/kspread_dlg_csv.cc:719
#: xml_doc.cc:2409
#, no-c-format
msgid "Currency"
msgstr "Geldsort"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 873
#: xml_doc.cc:2412
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The EURO() function converts one Euro to a given national currency in the "
"European monetary union. Currency is one of the following: ATS (Austria), BEF "
"(Belgium), DEM (Germany), ESP (Spain), FIM (Finland), FRF (France), GRD "
"(Greece), IEP (Ireland), ITL (Italy), LUF (Luxembourg), NLG (Netherlands), or "
"PTE (Portugal)."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon EURO() wannelt een Euro na en angeven natschonaal Geldsort in de "
"europääsch Geldsortenunioon üm. Geldsorten sünd: ATS (Österriek), BEF "
"(Belgien), DEM (Düütschland), ESP (Spanien), FIM (Finnland), FRF (Frankriek), "
"GRD (Grekenland), IEP (Irland), ITL (Italien), LUF (Luxemborg), NLG "
"(Nedderlannen), oder PTE (Portugal)."

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 874
#: xml_doc.cc:2415
#, no-c-format
msgid "EURO(currency)"
msgstr "EURO(Geldsort)"

#. i18n: file extensions/financial.xml line 875
#: xml_doc.cc:2418
#, no-c-format
msgid "EURO(\"DEM\") equals 1.95583"
msgstr "EURO(\"DEM\") is liek as 1,95583"

#. i18n: file extensions/information.xml line 15
#: xml_doc.cc:2427
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The N() function converts a value to a number. If value is or refers to a "
"number, this function returns the number. If value is True, this function "
"returns 1. If a value is a date, this function returns the serial number of "
"that date. Anything else will cause the function to return 0."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon N() reekt en Weert na en Tall üm. Wenn de Weert en Tall is oder "
"na en Tall verwiest, gifft disse Funkschoon en Tall torüch. Wenn de Weert wohr "
"is, warrt \"1\" torüchgeven. Wenn de Weert en Datum is, gifft de Funkschoon de "
"Seriennummer vun't Datum torüch. För all anner Weerten warrt \"0\" torüchgeven."

#. i18n: file extensions/information.xml line 16
#: xml_doc.cc:2430
#, no-c-format
msgid "N(value)"
msgstr "N(Weert)"

#. i18n: file extensions/information.xml line 17
#: xml_doc.cc:2433
#, no-c-format
msgid "N(3.14) returns 3.14"
msgstr "N(3,14) gifft \"3,14\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/information.xml line 18
#: xml_doc.cc:2436
#, no-c-format
msgid "N(\"7\") returns 0 (because \"7\" is text)"
msgstr "N(\"7\") gifft \"0\" torüch (wiel \"7\" Text is)"

#. i18n: file extensions/information.xml line 26
#: xml_doc.cc:2439
#, no-c-format
msgid "Type of information"
msgstr "Informatschoon-Typ"

#. i18n: file extensions/information.xml line 30
#: xml_doc.cc:2442
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The INFO() function returns information about the current operating "
"environment. Parameter type specifies what type of information you want to "
"return. It is one of the following: \"directory\" returns the path of the "
"current directory, \"numfile\" returns the number of active documents, "
"\"release\" returns the version of KSpread as text, \"recalc\" returns the "
"current recalculation mode: \"Automatic\" or \"Manual\", \"system\" returns the "
"name of the operating environment, \"osversion\" returns the current operating "
"system."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon INFO() gifft Informatschonen över de aktuell Bedriefümgeven "
"torüch. De Parameter \"Typ\" leggt de Oort vun torüchgeven Informatschonen "
"fast. Mööglich Weerten sünd: \"directory\" gifft den aktuellen Orner sien Padd "
"torüch, \"numfile\" gifft de Tall vun aktiv Dokmenten torüch, \"release\" gifft "
"de Verschoon vun KSpread as Text ut, \"recalc\" gifft de aktuell "
"Niegutrekenmetood torüch: \"Automaatsch\" oder \"vun Hand\", \"system\" gifft "
"den Bedriefümgeven-Naam torüch un \"osversion\" dat aktuelle Bedriefsysteem."

#. i18n: file extensions/information.xml line 31
#: xml_doc.cc:2445
#, no-c-format
msgid "INFO(type)"
msgstr "INFO(Typ)"

#. i18n: file extensions/information.xml line 39
#: xml_doc.cc:2448 xml_doc.cc:2463 xml_doc.cc:2478 xml_doc.cc:2493
#: xml_doc.cc:2508 xml_doc.cc:2523 xml_doc.cc:2538 xml_doc.cc:2553
#: xml_doc.cc:2568 xml_doc.cc:2583 xml_doc.cc:2598 xml_doc.cc:2613
#: xml_doc.cc:2628 xml_doc.cc:2637 xml_doc.cc:2646 xml_doc.cc:2655
#, no-c-format
msgid "Any value"
msgstr "Jichtenseen Weert"

#. i18n: file extensions/information.xml line 43
#: xml_doc.cc:2451
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The ISLOGICAL() function returns True if the parameter is a boolean value. "
"Otherwise it returns False."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ISLOGICAL() gifft \"wohr\" torüch, wenn de Parameter en boolsch "
"Weert is. Anners warrt \"falsch\" torüchgeven."

#. i18n: file extensions/information.xml line 44
#: xml_doc.cc:2454
#, no-c-format
