msgid ""
"The STDEV() function returns the estimate standard deviation based on a sample. "
"The standard deviation is a measure of how widely values are dispersed from the "
"average value."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon STDEV() gifft den vermoodt Standardverscheel baseert op en "
"Steekproov torüch. De Standardverscheel is en Maat för de Streuen vun den "
"Dörsnittweert."

