#: xml_doc.cc:5343 xml_doc.cc:5361
#, no-c-format
msgid "Decimals"
msgstr "Dezimaalsteden"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 19
#: xml_doc.cc:5346
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The DOLLAR() function converts a number to text using currency format, with the "
"decimals rounded to the specified place. Although the name is DOLLAR, this "
"function will do the conversion according to the current locale."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon DOLLAR() wannelt en Tall in't aktuelle Geldformaat na Text üm un "
"rundt de Nakommasteden as angeven. Ok wenn de Naam \"DOLLAR\" is, warrt de "
"lokaal instellt Geldsort ümwannelt."

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 20
#: xml_doc.cc:5349
#, no-c-format
msgid "DOLLAR(number;decimals)"
msgstr "DOLLAR(Tall;Dezimaalsteden)"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 21
#: xml_doc.cc:5352
#, no-c-format
msgid "DOLLAR(1403.77) returns \"$ 1,403.77\""
msgstr "DOLLAR(1403,77) gifft \"\"EUR 1 403,77\"\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 22
#: xml_doc.cc:5355
#, no-c-format
msgid "DOLLAR(-0.123;4) returns \"$-0.1230\""
msgstr "DOLLAR(-0,123;4) gifft \"EUR -0,1230\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 38
#: xml_doc.cc:5364
#, no-c-format
msgid "No_commas"
msgstr "Keen_trenntekens"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 42
#: xml_doc.cc:5367
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The FIXED() function rounds a number to the specified number of decimals, "
"formats the number in decimal format string, and returns the result as text. If "
"decimals is negative, number is rounded to the left of the decimal point. If "
"you omit decimals, it is assumed to be 2. If optional parameter no_commas is "
"True, thousand separators will not show up."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon FIXED() rundt en Tall na de angeven Tall vun Dezimaalsteden, "
"formateert ehr as en Dezimaalformaat-Tekenkeed un gifft dat Resultaat as Text "
"ut. Wenn \"Dezimaalsteden\" negativ is, warrt de Tall links den Dezimaalpunkt "
"rundt. Ahn \"Dezimaalsteden\" warrt \"2\" vermoodt. Wenn de optschonaal "
"Parameter \"keen_trenntekens\" wohr is, warrt de Dusennerkoppels ahn "
"Trenntekens wiest."

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 43
#: xml_doc.cc:5370
#, no-c-format
msgid "FIXED(number;decimals;no_commas)"
msgstr "FIXED(Tall;Dezimaalsteden;Keen_trenntekens)"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 44
#: xml_doc.cc:5373
#, no-c-format
msgid "FIXED(1234.567;1) returns \"1,234.6\""
msgstr "FIXED(1234,567;1) gifft \"1 234,6\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 45
#: xml_doc.cc:5376
#, no-c-format
msgid "FIXED(1234.567;1;FALSE) returns \"1234.6\""
msgstr "FIXED(1234,567;1;wohr) gifft \"1234,6\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 46
#: xml_doc.cc:5379
#, no-c-format
msgid "FIXED(44.332) returns \"44.33\""
msgstr "FIXED(44,332) gifft \"44,33\" torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 54
#: xml_doc.cc:5382
#, no-c-format
msgid "Text for which you want to substitute"
msgstr "Text, binnen den utwesselt warrn schall"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 58
#: xml_doc.cc:5385
#, no-c-format
msgid "Part of text you want to replace"
msgstr "Deel vun den Text, de utwesselt warrn schall"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 62
#: xml_doc.cc:5388
#, no-c-format
msgid "New text which will be replacement"
msgstr "Utwesseltext"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 66
#: xml_doc.cc:5391
#, no-c-format
msgid "Occurrence of replacement"
msgstr "Utwesselvörkamen"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 70
#: xml_doc.cc:5394
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The SUBSTITUTE() substitutes new_text for old_text in a text string. If "
"instance_num is specified, only that instance of old_text is replaced. "
"Otherwise, every occurrence of old_text is changed to new_text. Use SUBSTITUTE "
"when you want to replace specific text, use REPLACE when you want to replace "
"any text that occurs in a specific location."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SUBSTITUTE() wesselt binnen en Tekenkeed \"Oolt_Text\" dör "
"\"Nieg_Text\" ut. Wenn \"Utgaav_Tall\" angeven is, warrt bloots disse Tall vun "
"\"Oolt_Text\" utwesselt. Anners warrt elk Vörkamen vun \"Oolt_Text\" na "
"\"Nieg_Text\" ännert. Bruuk \"SUBSTITUTE\" för't Utwesseln vun angeven Text un "
"\"REPLACE\" för't Utwesseln vun Text an en angeven Steed."

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 71
#: xml_doc.cc:5397
#, no-c-format
msgid "SUBSTITUTE(text; old_text; new_text; instance_num)"
msgstr "SUBSTITUTE(Text; Oolt_Text; Nieg_Text; Utgaav_Tall)"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 72
#: xml_doc.cc:5400
#, no-c-format
msgid "SUBSTITUTE(\"Cost Data\";\"Cost\";\"Sales\") returns \"Sales Data\""
msgstr ""
"SUBSTITUTE(\"Köstendaten\";\"Kösten\";\"Verkoop\") gifft \"Verkoopdaten\" ut"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 73
#: xml_doc.cc:5403
#, no-c-format
msgid "SUBSTITUTE(\"Qtr 1, 2001\";\"1\";\"3\";1) returns \"Qtr 3, 2001\""
msgstr ""
"SUBSTITUTE(\"Quartaal 1, 2001\";\"1\";\"3\";1) gifft \"Quartaal 3, 2001\" "
"torüch"

#. i18n: file extensions/text.xml line 74
#: xml_doc.cc:5406
#, no-c-format
msgid "SUBSTITUTE(\"Qtr 1, 2001\";\"1\";\"3\";4) returns \"Qtr 3, 2003\""
msgstr ""
"SUBSTITUTE(\"Quartaal 1, 2001\";\"1\";\"3\";4) gifft \"Quartaal 3, 2003\" "
"torüch"

