#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1095
msgid ""
"This is the default format and KSpread autodetects the actual data type "
"depending on the current cell data. By default, KSpread right justifies "
"numbers, dates and times within a cell and left justifies anything else."
msgstr ""
"Dit is dat Standardformaat. De aktuell Datentyp warrt mit Hülp vun de aktuellen "
"Zelldaten automaatsch rutfunnen. Standardwies warrt Tallen, Datum- un "
"Tietangaven binnen en Zell rechterhand utricht, un all anner Indrääg links."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1099
msgid ""
"The number notation uses the notation you globally choose in KControl -> "
"Regional & Accessibility -> Numbers tab. Numbers are right justified by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"De Schriefwies vun Tallen bruukt de systeemwiet fastleggt Instellen ut "
"\"Kuntrullzentrum\" -> \"Regioon un Behinnertenhülp\" -> "
"\"Land/Regioon un Spraak\" ->\"Tallen\". Standardwies warrt Tallen rechterhand "
"utricht."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1102
msgid "Percent"
msgstr "Perzent"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1103
msgid ""
"When you have a number in the current cell and you switch from the dcell format "
"from Generic to Percent, the current cell number will be multiplied by 100%.\n"
"For example if you enter 12 and set the cell format to Percent, the number will "
"then be 1,200 %. Switching back to Generic cell format will bring it back to "
"12.\n"
"You can also use the Percent icon in the Format Toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Wenn binnen de aktuell Zell en Tall steiht un Een dat Zellformaat vun "
"\"Allgemeen\" na \"Perzent\" wesselt, warrt de aktuell Tall mit 100% "
"maalnahmen.\n"
"En Ingaav vun t.B. 12 warrt na't Wesseln vun't Zellformaat na Perzent to 1200% "
"wannelt. Torüchwesseln na't allgemeen Zellformaat ännert se wedder na 12 üm.\n"
"Een kann dor ok dat Perzent-Lüttbild binnen den Formaat-Warktüüchbalken för "
"bruken."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1106
msgid "Money"
msgstr "Geld"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1107
msgid ""
"The Money format converts your number into money notation using the settings "
"globally fixed in KControl in Regional & Accessibility -> "
"Money. The currency symbol will be displayed and the precision will be the one "
"set in KControl.\n"
"You can also use the Currency icon in the Format Toolbar to set the cell "
"formatting to look like your current currency."
msgstr ""
"Dat Geldformaat wannelt Dien Tall na de Geldschriefwies üm. Dor warrt de "
"systeemwiet Instellen ut \"Kuntrullzentrum\" -> \"Regioon un Behinnertenhülp\" "
"->\"Land/Regioon un Spraak\" -> \"Geld\" för bruukt. Dat Geldlüttbild warrt "
"wiest un de Nauigkeit bruukt, de in't Kuntrullzentrum fastleggt is.\n"
"Een kann för't Topassen ok dat Geldlüttbild ut den Formaat-Warktüüchbalken "
"bruken, dormit dat Zellformaat liek Dien aktuell Geldsort lett."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1110
msgid "Scientific"
msgstr "Wetenschaplich"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1111
msgid ""
"The scientific format changes your number using the scientific notation. For "
"example, 0.0012 will be changed to 1.2E-03. Going back using Generic cell "
"format will display 0.0012 again."
msgstr ""
"Dat wetenschaplich Formaat ännert de Tall na de wetenschaplich Schriefwies, "
"t.B. 1,2E-03 ansteed vun  0,0012. Torüch na't Standard-Zellenformaat warrt "
"wedder 0,0012 wiest."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1115
msgid ""
"The fraction format changes your number into a fraction. For example, 0.1 can "
"be changed to 1/8, 2/16, 1/10, etc. You define the type of fraction by choosing "
"it in the field on the right. If the exact fraction is not possible in the "
"fraction mode you choose, the nearest closest match is chosen.\n"
" For example: when we have 1.5 as number, we choose Fraction and Sixteenths "
"1/16 the text displayed into cell is \"1 8/16\" which is an exact fraction. If "
"you have 1.4 as number in your cell and you choose Fraction and Sixteenths 1/16 "
"then the cell will display \"1 6/16\" which is the nearest closest Sixteenth "
"fraction."
msgstr ""
"Dat Brook-Formaat ännert de Tall na en Brook. So lett sik t.B. 0,1 na 1/8, "
"2/16, 1/10 usw. ännern. In't Feld rechterhand warrt de Brooktyp fastleggt. Wenn "
"de Brook mit den utsöchten Typ nich nau mööglich is, warrt de dichtst bi leggen "
"bruukt.\n"
"För t.B. 1,5 as Tall un wenn Brook un Sössteihndel 1/16 utsöcht is, warrt in de "
"Zell \"1 8/16\" wiest, wat en nau Brook is. För 1,4 as Tall un wenn Brook un "
"Sössteihndel 1/16 utsöcht is, warrt \"1 6/16\" wiest, wat de dichtst bi liggen "
"Sössteihndel-Brook is."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1118
msgid "Date format"
msgstr "Datumformaat"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1119
msgid ""
"To enter a date, you should enter it in one of the formats set in KControl in "
"Regional & Accessibility ->Time & Dates. There are two formats set here: the "
"date format and the short date format.\n"
"Just like you can drag down numbers you can also drag down dates and the next "
"cells will also get dates."
msgstr ""
"En Datum schall in een vun de twee Tietformaten ingeven warrn, de in't "
"Kuntrullzentrum bi \"Regioon un Behinnertenhülp\" -> "
"\"Land/Regioon un Spraak\" -> \"Tiet un Datum\" fastleggt sünd. Hier laat sik "
"twee Formaten instellen: Dat Datumformaat un dat kort Datumformaat.\n"
"Liek Tallen sik daaltrecken laat, so laat sik ok Daten daaltrecken un de "
"nakamen Zellen bargt denn ok Daten."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1122
msgid "Time format"
msgstr "Tietformaat"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1123
msgid ""
"This formats your cell content as a time. To enter a time, you should enter it "
"in the Time format set in KControl in Regional & Accessibility ->"
"Time & Dates. In the Cell Format dialog box you can set how the time should be "
"displayed by choosing one of the available time format options. The default "
"format is the system format set in KControl. When the number in the cell does "
"not make sense as a time, KSpread will display 00:00 in the global format you "
"have in KControl."
msgstr ""
"Dit formateert den Zellinholt as Tiet. En Tiet schall in't Tietformaat ingeven "
"warrn, dat in't Kuntrullzentrum bi \"Regioon un Behinnertenhülp\" -> "
"\"Land/Regioon un Spraak\" -> \"Tiet un Datum\" instellt is. In't Menü "
"\"Zellenformaat\" lett sik ut verscheden Formaten utsöken, wodennig de Tiet "
"wiest warrt. Dat Standardformaat is dat in't Kuntrullzentrum fastleggt "
"Systeemformaat. Wenn de Tall binnen de Zell sik nich as gellen Tietangaav "
"bruken lett, warrt 00:00 in't globaal Tietformaat wiest."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1127
msgid ""
"This formats your cell content as text. This can be useful if you want a number "
"treated as text instead as a number, for example for a ZIP code. Setting a "
"number as text format will left justify it. When numbers are formatted as text, "
"they cannot be used in calculations or formulas. It also change the way the "
"cell is justified."
msgstr ""
"Dit formateert den Zellinholt as Text. Dat kann wat bringen, wenn Een en Tall "
"as Text un nich as Tall behanneln will, t.B. en Postleddtall. En as Text "
"formateert Tall warrt linkerhand utricht. Wenn Tallen as Text formateert warrt, "
"laat se sik nich för't Utreken oder för Formeln bruken. Dit ännert ok de "
"Zellutrichten."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1130
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Egen"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1131
msgid "The custom format does not work yet. To be enabled in the next release."
msgstr "Dat egen Formaat löppt noch nich. In en tokamen Utgaav villicht."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1140
msgid ""
"This will display a preview of your choice so you can know what it does before "
"clicking the OK button to validate it."
msgstr ""
"Dit wiest en Vöransicht vun Dien Utwahl, so dat Du de Ännern ankieken kannst, "
"ehr Du op \"OK\" klickst."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1151
msgid "Displays choices of format for the fraction, date or time formats."
msgstr "Wiest de Formaatutwahl för Bröök, Datum un Tiet."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1161
msgid ""
"You can add here a Postfix such as a $HK symbol to the end of each cell content "
"in the checked format."
msgstr ""
"Hier lett sik en Postfix liek t.B. en $HK-Symbool na elk Zellinholt in't "
"utsöcht Formaat tofögen."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1164
msgid "variable"
msgstr "Variable"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1166
msgid ""
"You can control how many digits are displayed after the decimal point for "
"numeric values. This can also be changed using the Increase precision or "
"Decrease precision icons in the Format toolbar. "
msgstr ""
"Hier laat sik de Tall vun Nakommasteden för numeersch Weerten stüern. stüern. "
"Dit lett sik ok binnen den Formaat-Warktüüchbalken mit de Lüttbiller \"Höger "
"Nauigkeit\" oder \"Sieter Nauigkeit\" ännern. "

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1170
msgid ""
"You can add here a Prefix such as a $ symbol at the start of each cell content "
"in the checked format."
msgstr ""
"Hier lett sik en Prefix liek t.B. en $-Symbool vör elk Zellinholt in't utsöcht "
"Formaat tofögen."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_layout.cc:1174
msgid ""
"You can choose whether positive values are displayed with a leading + sign and "
"whether negative values are shown in red."
msgstr ""
"Hier lett sik fastleggen, wat positiv Weerten en \"+\" vöranstellt warrt un wat "
"negativ Weerten root dorstellt warrt."

