"the Statusbar Summary  function."
msgstr ""
"Disse Utwahl-List lett sik för't Utsöken vun de Utrekenmetood för de "
"Tosamenfaat-Funkschoon binnen den Statusbalken bruken."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:490
msgid ""
"Lets you define the amount of indenting used by the Increase Indent and "
"Decrease Indent option in the Format menu."
msgstr ""
"Hier lett sik de Inrückenwiet vun't Menü \"Formaat -> "
"Mehr inrücken\" oder \"Formaat -> Weniger inrücken\" fastleggen."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:491
msgid "&Indentation step (%1):"
msgstr "&Inrückenschritt (%1):"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:493
msgid "&Show error message for invalid formulae"
msgstr "Fehlermellen bi leeg Formeln &wiesen"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:495
msgid ""
"If this box is checked a message box will pop up when what you have entered "
"into a cell cannot be understood by KSpread."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, gifft dat bi leeg Zelleningaven en Narichten-Opduker."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:735
msgid "&Grid color:"
msgstr "&Gadderklöör:"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:740
msgid ""
"Click here to change the grid color ie the color of the borders of each cell."
msgstr ""
"Klick hier, wenn Du de Gadderklöör ännern wullt, t.B. de Zellengrenzen ehr "
"Klören."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:750
msgid "&Page borders:"
msgstr "&Siedenränners:"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:755
msgid ""
"When the View ->Show Page Borders menu item is checked, the page borders are "
"displayed. Click here to choose another color for the borders than the default "
"red."
msgstr ""
"Wenn de Menüpunkt \"Ansicht -> Siedenränners\" anmaakt is, warrt de "
"Siedenränners wiest. Klick hier, wenn Du en anner Klöör as dat Standardroot för "
"de Ränners bruken wullt."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:802
msgid "Default page &size:"
msgstr "Standard-&Siedengrött:"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:810
msgid ""
"Choose the default page size for your worksheet among all the most common page "
"sizes.\n"
"Note that you can overwrite the page size for the current sheet using the "
"Format -> Page Layout... dialog."
msgstr ""
"De Standard-Sietgrött för de Tabell ut tomehrst bruukt Siedengrötten utsöken.\n"
"Beacht, dat sik de aktuell Tabell ehr Sietgrött binnen den Dialoog \"Formaat\" "
"-> \"Siet-Utsehn\" överschrieven lett."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:813
msgid "Default page &orientation:"
msgstr "Standard-Siet&utrichten:"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:824
msgid ""
"Choose the sheet orientation: portrait or lanscape.\n"
"Note that you can overwrite the orientation for the current sheet using the "
"Format -> Page Layout... dialog."
msgstr ""
"De Tabell-Utrichten utsöken: Hooch- oder Dwarsformaat.\n"
"Beacht, dat sik de aktuell Tabell ehr Siet-Utrichten binnen den Dialoog "
"\"Formaat\" -> \"Siet-Utsehn\" överschrieven lett."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:828
msgid "Default page &unit:"
msgstr "Standard-Sieden&eenheit:"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:835
msgid ""
"Choose the default unit that will be used in your sheet.\n"
"Note that you can overwrite the unit for the current sheet using the Format -> "
"Page Layout... dialog."
msgstr ""
"De Standardeenheit för de Tabell utsöken.\n"
"Beacht, dat sik de aktuell Tabell ehr Eenheit binnen den Dialoog \"Formaat\" -> "
"\"Siet-Utsehn\" överschrieven lett."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:902
msgid "Skip all uppercase words"
msgstr "All Wöör in Grootbookstaven övergahn"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:903
msgid ""
"If checked, the words written in uppercase letters are not spell checked. This "
"might be useful if you have a lot of acronyms such as KDE for example."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt Wöör in Grootbookstaven nich pröövt. Dat kann wat "
"nütten, wenn Een vele Akronümen as t.B. \"KDE\" bruukt."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:904
msgid "Do not check title case"
msgstr "Groot-/Lüttschrieven vun den Titel nich pröven"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_preference.cc:905
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want the spellchecker to ignore the title case, for "
"example My Own Spreadsheet or My own spreadsheet. If this is unchecked, the "
"spell checker will ask for a uppercase letter in the title nouns."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn de Klookschriever de Groot-/Lüttschrieven vun den Titel "
"övergahn schall, t.B. \"Mien Egen Tabell\" oder \"Mien egen Tabell\". Wenn dit "
"utmaakt is, fraagt de Klookschriever na Grootbookstaven för Naamwöör binnen "
"Titeln."

