msgstr "De Reeg waagrecht infögen, vun links na rechts"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:71
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Typ"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:72
msgid "Linear (2,4,6,...)"
msgstr "Lineaar (2, 4, 6, ...)"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:73
msgid ""
"Generate a series from 'start' to 'end' and for each step add the value "
"provided in step. This creates a series where each value is 'step' larger than "
"the value before it."
msgstr ""
"En Reeg vun \"Start\" na \"Enn\" opstellen un jümmers den för \"Schritt\" "
"angeven Weert tofögen. Dor kummt denn en Reeg bi rut, bi de elk nakamen Weert "
"üm \"Schritt\" grötter is as de vörangahn Weert."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:76
msgid "Geometric (2,4,8,...)"
msgstr "Geometersch (2, 4, 8, ...)"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:77
msgid ""
"Generate a series from 'start' to 'end' and for each step multiply the value "
"with the value provided in step. Using a step of 5 produces a list like: 5, 25, "
"125, 625 since 5 multiplied by 5 (step) equals 25, and that multiplied by 5 "
"equals 125, which multiplied by the same step-value of 5 equals 625."
msgstr ""
"En Reeg vun \"Start\" na \"Enn\" opstellen un jümmers mit den för \"Schritt\" "
"angeven Weert maalnehmen. Mit en Schritt vun \"5\" gifft dat en List liek 5, "
"25, 125, 625, wiel 5 maal 5 (Schritt) 25 maakt, un dat maal 5 denn 125, un dat "
"denn wedder maal den Schritt 5 625."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:84
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:90
msgid "Start value:"
msgstr "Startweert:"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:93
msgid "Stop value:"
msgstr "Ennweert:"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:96
msgid "Step value:"
msgstr "Schrittweert:"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:137
msgid "End and start value must be positive."
msgstr "Enn- un Startweert mööt positiv wesen."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:142
msgid ""
"End value must be greater than the start value or the step must be less than "
"'1'."
msgstr ""
"De Ennweert mutt grötter as de Startweert wesen, oder de Schritt mutt lütter as "
"\"1\" wesen."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:147
msgid "None of the Start, Stop or Step values may be equal to zero."
msgstr "Start-, Enn- oder Schrittweerten mööt nich \"0\" wesen."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:152
msgid "Step value must be different from 1"
msgstr "Schrittweert mutt nich \"1\" wesen"

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:161
msgid ""
"The step value must be greater than zero; otherwise, the linear series is "
"infinite."
msgstr ""
"De Schrittweert mutt grötter as Null wesen, anners gifft dat en lineaar Reeg "
"ahn Enn."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:177
msgid ""
"If the start value is greater than the end value the step must be less than "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"Wenn de Startweert grötter as de Ennweert is, mutt de Schritt lütter as Null "
"wesen."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:183
msgid "Step is negative."
msgstr "Schritt is negativ."

#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_series.cc:191
msgid ""
"If the step is negative, the start value must be greater then the end value."
msgstr ""
"Wenn de Schritt negativ is, mutt de Startweert grötter as de Ennweert wesen."

